| Basic drink (local sake, good shōchū, beer) | 2–3 zeni | 4–5 zeni | For one person for one day, without drinking in excess |
| Luxury drink (premium and imported sake, imported wine) | 2–4 bu | 1 koku or more | For one person for one day, without drinking in excess |
| Basic consumer goods (tatami mats, futons) | 5–7 zeni | 1 bu or more | Per item; though some items, like utensils, may come in packages of several |
